[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9842.79, "timestamp": "02:44:02", "text": "GPD，这样它就知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9845.67, "timestamp": "02:44:05", "text": "独裁者可能会利用它来寻找……我想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9856.71, "timestamp": "02:44:16", "text": "我当时也在报告一份法律声明，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9859.67, "timestamp": "02:44:19", "text": "通知也太疯狂了，我不想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9861.75, "timestamp": "02:44:21", "text": "收到……你会对我撒那么多谎，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9874.309, "timestamp": "02:44:34", "text": "[嗤笑]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9877.429, "timestamp": "02:44:37", "text": "等等，我是说，我不知道问这个问题是否合适"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9880.309, "timestamp": "02:44:40", "text": "，但是你的东西真的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9883.11, "timestamp": "02:44:43", "text": "会变成像箱子之类的东西吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9888.638, "timestamp": "02:44:48", "text": "或者它像法律通知一样，或者像……（"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9891.349, "timestamp": "02:44:51", "text": "嗤笑）……该怎么称呼它呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9893.75, "timestamp": "02:44:53", "text": "呃，是发出停止侵权通知之类的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9895.83, "timestamp": "02:44:55", "text": "还是真的要上法庭之"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9898.07, "timestamp": "02:44:58", "text": "类的？"}]